[{"id":"iftara-10-69-3","words":["verb:iftara"],"options":[{"bs":"izmišljaju","en":"(they) fabricate"},{"bs":"izmišlja laž","en":"he/it fabricates"},{"bs":"(ko) izmisli","en":"(whoever) fabricates"},{"bs":"izmislio sam ga","en":"I fabricated it"}],"ref":"10:69","answerWord":"يَفْتَرُونَ","answerSound":"audio/0250b52f0de187c39acd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Verily those who invent a lie concerning Allah will not succeed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izmisliti laž","en":"to fabricate, to invent a lie"},"passage":["قُلْ","إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَفْتَرُونَ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","ٱلْكَذِبَ","لَا","يُفْلِحُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"افْتَرَى"}},{"id":"iftara-3-94-1","words":["verb:iftara"],"options":[{"bs":"(ko) izmisli","en":"(whoever) fabricates"},{"bs":"biva izmišljen","en":"he/it is fabricated"},{"bs":"izmislili smo laž","en":"we fabricated"},{"bs":"da izmislite laž","en":"so that you (all) may fabricate"}],"ref":"3:94","answerWord":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/a40b825a14e57d0e0fea.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whoever shall invent a falsehood after that concerning Allah, such will be wrong-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izmisliti laž","en":"to fabricate, to invent a lie"},"passage":["فَمَنِ","ٱفْتَرَىٰ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","ٱلْكَذِبَ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","ذَٰلِكَ","فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","هُمُ","ٱلظَّٰلِمُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"افْتَرَى"}},{"id":"iftara-10-38-2","words":["verb:iftara"],"options":[{"bs":"izmislio ga je","en":"he/it fabricated it"},{"bs":"izmislili smo laž","en":"we fabricated"},{"bs":"zar je izmislio laž?","en":"did he/it fabricate?"},{"bs":"izmišljate laž","en":"you (all) fabricate"}],"ref":"10:38","answerWord":"ٱفْتَرَىٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/40251ea061637b71a2a5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or say they: He hath invented it? Say: Then bring a surah like unto it, and call (for help) on all ye can besides Allah, if ye are truthful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izmisliti laž","en":"to fabricate, to invent a lie"},"passage":["أَمْ","يَقُولُونَ","ٱفْتَرَىٰهُ","قُلْ","فَأْتُوا۟","بِسُورَةٍ","مِّثْلِهِۦ","وَٱدْعُوا۟","مَنِ","ٱسْتَطَعْتُم","مِّن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","صَٰدِقِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"افْتَرَى"}},{"id":"iftara-10-37-5","words":["verb:iftara"],"options":[{"bs":"biva izmišljen","en":"he/it is fabricated"},{"bs":"izmislio sam ga","en":"I fabricated it"},{"bs":"izmislili smo laž","en":"we fabricated"},{"bs":"izmišljate laž","en":"you (all) fabricate"}],"ref":"10:37","answerWord":"يُفْتَرَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/cdb668fb8bb0dad4aecd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And this Qur'an is not such as could ever be invented in despite of Allah; but it is a confirmation of that which was before it and an exposition of that which is decreed for mankind - Therein is no doubt - from the Lord of the Worlds.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izmisliti laž","en":"to fabricate, to invent a lie"},"passage":["وَمَا","كَانَ","هَٰذَا","ٱلْقُرْءَانُ","أَن","يُفْتَرَىٰ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَلَٰكِن","تَصْدِيقَ","ٱلَّذِى","بَيْنَ","يَدَيْهِ","وَتَفْصِيلَ","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","لَا","رَيْبَ","فِيهِ","مِن","رَّبِّ","ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"افْتَرَى"}},{"id":"iftara-16-56-11","words":["verb:iftara"],"options":[{"bs":"izmišljate laž","en":"you (all) fabricate"},{"bs":"izmislili smo laž","en":"we fabricated"},{"bs":"izmislio ga je","en":"he/it fabricated it"},{"bs":"zar je izmislio laž?","en":"did he/it fabricate?"}],"ref":"16:56","answerWord":"تَفْتَرُونَ","answerSound":"audio/73d56a0ae2a05c454807.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they assign a portion of that which We have given them unto what they know not. By Allah! but ye will indeed be asked concerning (all) that ye used to invent.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izmisliti laž","en":"to fabricate, to invent a lie"},"passage":["وَيَجْعَلُونَ","لِمَا","لَا","يَعْلَمُونَ","نَصِيبًا","مِّمَّا","رَزَقْنَٰهُمْ","تَٱللَّهِ","لَتُسْـَٔلُنَّ","عَمَّا","كُنتُمْ","تَفْتَرُونَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"افْتَرَى"}},{"id":"iftara-11-35-5","words":["verb:iftara"],"options":[{"bs":"izmislio sam ga","en":"I fabricated it"},{"bs":"izmislio je laž","en":"he/it fabricated"},{"bs":"izmišljate laž","en":"you (all) fabricate"},{"bs":"biva izmišljen","en":"he/it is fabricated"}],"ref":"11:35","answerWord":"ٱفْتَرَيْتُهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/02be770e2a784348e3d3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or say they (again): He hath invented it? Say: If I have invented it, upon me be my crimes, but I am innocent of (all) that ye commit.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izmisliti laž","en":"to fabricate, to invent a lie"},"passage":["أَمْ","يَقُولُونَ","ٱفْتَرَىٰهُ","قُلْ","إِنِ","ٱفْتَرَيْتُهُۥ","فَعَلَىَّ","إِجْرَامِى","وَأَنَا۠","بَرِىٓءٌ","مِّمَّا","تُجْرِمُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"افْتَرَى"}},{"id":"iftara-4-48-17","words":["verb:iftara"],"options":[{"bs":"izmislio je laž","en":"he/it fabricated"},{"bs":"izmišljaju","en":"(they) fabricate"},{"bs":"da izmislite laž","en":"so that you (all) may fabricate"},{"bs":"izmislio ga je","en":"he/it fabricated it"}],"ref":"4:48","answerWord":"ٱفْتَرَىٰٓ","answerSound":"audio/64ea0ae199dcbaf5388b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Allah forgiveth not that a partner should be ascribed unto Him. He forgiveth (all) save that to whom He will. Whoso ascribeth partners to Allah, he hath indeed invented a tremendous sin.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izmisliti laž","en":"to fabricate, to invent a lie"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَا","يَغْفِرُ","أَن","يُشْرَكَ","بِهِۦ","وَيَغْفِرُ","مَا","دُونَ","ذَٰلِكَ","لِمَن","يَشَآءُ","وَمَن","يُشْرِكْ","بِٱللَّهِ","فَقَدِ","ٱفْتَرَىٰٓ","إِثْمًا","عَظِيمًا"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"افْتَرَى"}},{"id":"iftara-16-105-1","words":["verb:iftara"],"options":[{"bs":"izmišlja laž","en":"he/it fabricates"},{"bs":"izmislio je laž","en":"he/it fabricated"},{"bs":"izmislili smo laž","en":"we fabricated"},{"bs":"izmišljate laž","en":"you (all) fabricate"}],"ref":"16:105","answerWord":"يَفْتَرِى","answerSound":"audio/8130d4a93d2f4e9cc869.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Only they invent falsehood who believe not Allah's revelations, and (only) they are the liars.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izmisliti laž","en":"to fabricate, to invent a lie"},"passage":["إِنَّمَا","يَفْتَرِى","ٱلْكَذِبَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ","بِـَٔايَٰتِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","هُمُ","ٱلْكَٰذِبُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"افْتَرَى"}},{"id":"iftara-16-116-10","words":["verb:iftara"],"options":[{"bs":"da izmislite laž","en":"so that you (all) may fabricate"},{"bs":"biva izmišljen","en":"he/it is fabricated"},{"bs":"izmislili smo laž","en":"we fabricated"},{"bs":"izmišljaju","en":"(they) fabricate"}],"ref":"16:116","answerWord":"لِّتَفْتَرُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/accd9aba4853faf5e17a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And speak not, concerning that which your own tongues qualify (as clean or unclean), the falsehood: \"This is lawful, and this is forbidden,\" so that ye invent a lie against Allah. Lo! those who invent a lie against Allah will not succeed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izmisliti laž","en":"to fabricate, to invent a lie"},"passage":["وَلَا","تَقُولُوا۟","لِمَا","تَصِفُ","أَلْسِنَتُكُمُ","ٱلْكَذِبَ","هَٰذَا","حَلَٰلٌ","وَهَٰذَا","حَرَامٌ","لِّتَفْتَرُوا۟","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","ٱلْكَذِبَ","إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَفْتَرُونَ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","ٱلْكَذِبَ","لَا","يُفْلِحُونَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"افْتَرَى"}},{"id":"iftara-20-61-5","words":["verb:iftara"],"options":[{"bs":"izmišljate laž","en":"you (all) fabricate"},{"bs":"izmislio sam ga","en":"I fabricated it"},{"bs":"izmislili smo laž","en":"we fabricated"},{"bs":"biva izmišljen","en":"he/it is fabricated"}],"ref":"20:61","answerWord":"تَفْتَرُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/d19512e2067c2b9537e4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Moses said unto them: Woe unto you! Invent not a lie against Allah, lest He extirpate you by some punishment. He who lieth faileth miserably.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izmisliti laž","en":"to fabricate, to invent a lie"},"passage":["قَالَ","لَهُم","مُّوسَىٰ","وَيْلَكُمْ","لَا","تَفْتَرُوا۟","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","كَذِبًا","فَيُسْحِتَكُم","بِعَذَابٍ","وَقَدْ","خَابَ","مَنِ","ٱفْتَرَىٰ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"افْتَرَى"}},{"id":"iftara-34-8-0","words":["verb:iftara"],"options":[{"bs":"zar je izmislio laž?","en":"did he/it fabricate?"},{"bs":"izmišljate laž","en":"you (all) fabricate"},{"bs":"izmišlja laž","en":"he/it fabricates"},{"bs":"izmišljaju","en":"(they) fabricate"}],"ref":"34:8","answerWord":"أَفْتَرَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/d5d01d5d5703fceb9a00.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Hath he invented a lie concerning Allah, or is there in him a madness? Nay, but those who disbelieve in the Hereafter are in torment and far error.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izmisliti laž","en":"to fabricate, to invent a lie"},"passage":["أَفْتَرَىٰ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","كَذِبًا","أَم","بِهِۦ","جِنَّةٌۢ","بَلِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","فِى","ٱلْعَذَابِ","وَٱلضَّلَٰلِ","ٱلْبَعِيدِ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"افْتَرَى"}},{"id":"laana-4-52-2","words":["verb:laana"],"options":[{"bs":"prokleo ih je","en":"He cursed them"},{"bs":"prokleo ga je","en":"he/it cursed him"},{"bs":"i prokuni ih","en":"and curse them"},{"bs":"prokleti su","en":"they were cursed"}],"ref":"4:52","answerWord":"لَعَنَهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/a1e2249f5b0aea5ac781.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those are they whom Allah hath cursed, and he whom Allah hath cursed, thou (O Muhammad) wilt find for him no helper.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prokleti","en":"to curse"},"passage":["أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَعَنَهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","وَمَن","يَلْعَنِ","ٱللَّهُ","فَلَن","تَجِدَ","لَهُۥ","نَصِيرًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"لَعَنَ"}},{"id":"laana-2-88-4","words":["verb:laana"],"options":[{"bs":"prokleo ih je","en":"he/it cursed them"},{"bs":"prokleo ga je","en":"he/it cursed him"},{"bs":"i prokuni ih","en":"and curse them"},{"bs":"prokleli smo ih","en":"we cursed them"}],"ref":"2:88","answerWord":"لَّعَنَهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/86641b1725246dac280e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they say: Our hearts are hardened. Nay, but Allah hath cursed them for their unbelief. Little is that which they believe.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prokleti","en":"to curse"},"passage":["وَقَالُوا۟","قُلُوبُنَا","غُلْفٌۢ","بَل","لَّعَنَهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","بِكُفْرِهِمْ","فَقَلِيلًا","مَّا","يُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"لَعَنَ"}},{"id":"laana-4-118-0","words":["verb:laana"],"options":[{"bs":"prokleo ga je","en":"he/it cursed him"},{"bs":"prokleo ih je","en":"He cursed them"},{"bs":"proklinjemo ih","en":"we curse them"},{"bs":"proklela je","en":"she/it cursed"}],"ref":"4:118","answerWord":"لَّعَنَهُ","answerSound":"audio/93fcb0d285f13a759b9b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Whom Allah cursed, and he said: Surely I will take of Thy bondmen an appointed portion,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prokleti","en":"to curse"},"passage":["لَّعَنَهُ","ٱللَّهُ","وَقَالَ","لَأَتَّخِذَنَّ","مِنْ","عِبَادِكَ","نَصِيبًا","مَّفْرُوضًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"لَعَنَ"}},{"id":"laana-2-159-16","words":["verb:laana"],"options":[{"bs":"proklinje ih","en":"he/it curses them"},{"bs":"prokleo ih je","en":"He cursed them"},{"bs":"i prokleti su","en":"and they were cursed"},{"bs":"proklet je","en":"he/it was cursed"}],"ref":"2:159","answerWord":"يَلْعَنُهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/2eeaade03def3bcb9eeb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Those who hide the proofs and the guidance which We revealed, after We had made it clear to mankind in the Scripture: such are accursed of Allah and accursed of those who have the power to curse.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prokleti","en":"to curse"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَكْتُمُونَ","مَآ","أَنزَلْنَا","مِنَ","ٱلْبَيِّنَٰتِ","وَٱلْهُدَىٰ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","بَيَّنَّٰهُ","لِلنَّاسِ","فِى","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","يَلْعَنُهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","وَيَلْعَنُهُمُ","ٱللَّٰعِنُونَ"],"marked":[16],"facts":{"verb":"لَعَنَ"}},{"id":"laana-2-159-18","words":["verb:laana"],"options":[{"bs":"i proklinje ih","en":"and he/it curses them"},{"bs":"proklet je","en":"he/it was cursed"},{"bs":"prokleo ga je","en":"he/it cursed him"},{"bs":"i prokuni ih","en":"and curse them"}],"ref":"2:159","answerWord":"وَيَلْعَنُهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/f9be23ee25b53942462c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Those who hide the proofs and the guidance which We revealed, after We had made it clear to mankind in the Scripture: such are accursed of Allah and accursed of those who have the power to curse.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prokleti","en":"to curse"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَكْتُمُونَ","مَآ","أَنزَلْنَا","مِنَ","ٱلْبَيِّنَٰتِ","وَٱلْهُدَىٰ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","بَيَّنَّٰهُ","لِلنَّاسِ","فِى","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","يَلْعَنُهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","وَيَلْعَنُهُمُ","ٱللَّٰعِنُونَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"لَعَنَ"}},{"id":"laana-4-47-19","words":["verb:laana"],"options":[{"bs":"proklinjemo ih","en":"we curse them"},{"bs":"i prokleo ga je","en":"and he/it cursed him"},{"bs":"prokleo ih je","en":"He cursed them"},{"bs":"i prokuni ih","en":"and curse them"}],"ref":"4:47","answerWord":"نَلْعَنَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/bfd709a1d0e3b4bf704f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye unto whom the Scripture hath been given! Believe in what We have revealed confirming that which ye possess, before We destroy countenances so as to confound them, or curse them as We cursed the Sabbath-breakers (of old time). The commandment of Allah is always executed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prokleti","en":"to curse"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","أُوتُوا۟","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","ءَامِنُوا۟","بِمَا","نَزَّلْنَا","مُصَدِّقًا","لِّمَا","مَعَكُم","مِّن","قَبْلِ","أَن","نَّطْمِسَ","وُجُوهًا","فَنَرُدَّهَا","عَلَىٰٓ","أَدْبَارِهَآ","أَوْ","نَلْعَنَهُمْ","كَمَا","لَعَنَّآ","أَصْحَٰبَ","ٱلسَّبْتِ","وَكَانَ","أَمْرُ","ٱللَّهِ","مَفْعُولًا"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"لَعَنَ"}},{"id":"laana-4-47-21","words":["verb:laana"],"options":[{"bs":"prokleli smo","en":"we cursed"},{"bs":"prokune","en":"He curses"},{"bs":"prokleti su","en":"they were cursed"},{"bs":"i prokuni ih","en":"and curse them"}],"ref":"4:47","answerWord":"لَعَنَّآ","answerSound":"audio/00ab56996374f146a8c5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye unto whom the Scripture hath been given! Believe in what We have revealed confirming that which ye possess, before We destroy countenances so as to confound them, or curse them as We cursed the Sabbath-breakers (of old time). The commandment of Allah is always executed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prokleti","en":"to curse"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","أُوتُوا۟","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","ءَامِنُوا۟","بِمَا","نَزَّلْنَا","مُصَدِّقًا","لِّمَا","مَعَكُم","مِّن","قَبْلِ","أَن","نَّطْمِسَ","وُجُوهًا","فَنَرُدَّهَا","عَلَىٰٓ","أَدْبَارِهَآ","أَوْ","نَلْعَنَهُمْ","كَمَا","لَعَنَّآ","أَصْحَٰبَ","ٱلسَّبْتِ","وَكَانَ","أَمْرُ","ٱللَّهِ","مَفْعُولًا"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"لَعَنَ"}},{"id":"laana-4-52-5","words":["verb:laana"],"options":[{"bs":"prokune","en":"He curses"},{"bs":"i prokleti su","en":"and they were cursed"},{"bs":"prokleo ih je","en":"he/it cursed them"},{"bs":"i prokuni ih","en":"and curse them"}],"ref":"4:52","answerWord":"يَلْعَنِ","answerSound":"audio/22d22dfd405282d83cb2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those are they whom Allah hath cursed, and he whom Allah hath cursed, thou (O Muhammad) wilt find for him no helper.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prokleti","en":"to curse"},"passage":["أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَعَنَهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","وَمَن","يَلْعَنِ","ٱللَّهُ","فَلَن","تَجِدَ","لَهُۥ","نَصِيرًا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"لَعَنَ"}},{"id":"laana-4-93-11","words":["verb:laana"],"options":[{"bs":"i prokleo ga je","en":"and he/it cursed him"},{"bs":"prokleo ih je","en":"he/it cursed them"},{"bs":"prokune","en":"He curses"},{"bs":"i prokleti su","en":"and they were cursed"}],"ref":"4:93","answerWord":"وَلَعَنَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/d66387c5b64f7bb54804.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Whoso slayeth a believer of set purpose, his reward is hell for ever. Allah is wroth against him and He hath cursed him and prepared for him an awful doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prokleti","en":"to curse"},"passage":["وَمَن","يَقْتُلْ","مُؤْمِنًا","مُّتَعَمِّدًا","فَجَزَآؤُهُۥ","جَهَنَّمُ","خَٰلِدًا","فِيهَا","وَغَضِبَ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلَيْهِ","وَلَعَنَهُۥ","وَأَعَدَّ","لَهُۥ","عَذَابًا","عَظِيمًا"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"لَعَنَ"}},{"id":"laana-5-78-0","words":["verb:laana"],"options":[{"bs":"proklet je","en":"he/it was cursed"},{"bs":"proklinje ih","en":"he/it curses them"},{"bs":"i proklinje","en":"and he/it curses"},{"bs":"i prokleo ga je","en":"and he/it cursed him"}],"ref":"5:78","answerWord":"لُعِنَ","answerSound":"audio/6522ad10cdcbf25131ac.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those of the Children of Israel who went astray were cursed by the tongue of David, and of Jesus, son of Mary. That was because they rebelled and used to transgress.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prokleti","en":"to curse"},"passage":["لُعِنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","مِنۢ","بَنِىٓ","إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","عَلَىٰ","لِسَانِ","دَاوُۥدَ","وَعِيسَى","ٱبْنِ","مَرْيَمَ","ذَٰلِكَ","بِمَا","عَصَوا۟","وَّكَانُوا۟","يَعْتَدُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"لَعَنَ"}},{"id":"laana-9-68-11","words":["verb:laana"],"options":[{"bs":"i prokleo ih je","en":"and he/it cursed them"},{"bs":"i prokuni ih","en":"and curse them"},{"bs":"prokune","en":"He curses"},{"bs":"proklinjemo ih","en":"we curse them"}],"ref":"9:68","answerWord":"وَلَعَنَهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/e0a5226d8e3bd82301f6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah promiseth the hypocrites, both men and women, and the disbelievers fire of hell for their abode. It will suffice them. Allah curseth them, and theirs is lasting torment.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prokleti","en":"to curse"},"passage":["وَعَدَ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلْمُنَٰفِقِينَ","وَٱلْمُنَٰفِقَٰتِ","وَٱلْكُفَّارَ","نَارَ","جَهَنَّمَ","خَٰلِدِينَ","فِيهَا","هِىَ","حَسْبُهُمْ","وَلَعَنَهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","وَلَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","مُّقِيمٌ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"لَعَنَ"}},{"id":"laana-24-23-6","words":["verb:laana"],"options":[{"bs":"prokleti su","en":"they were cursed"},{"bs":"i proklinje","en":"and he/it curses"},{"bs":"i prokleo ih je","en":"and he/it cursed them"},{"bs":"i prokleo ga je","en":"and he/it cursed him"}],"ref":"24:23","answerWord":"لُعِنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/5b95f2e7934a4d44136c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! as for those who traduce virtuous, believing women (who are) careless, cursed are they in the world and the Hereafter. Theirs will be an awful doom","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prokleti","en":"to curse"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَرْمُونَ","ٱلْمُحْصَنَٰتِ","ٱلْغَٰفِلَٰتِ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنَٰتِ","لُعِنُوا۟","فِى","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","وَلَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","عَظِيمٌ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"لَعَنَ"}},{"id":"laana-29-25-18","words":["verb:laana"],"options":[{"bs":"i proklinje","en":"and he/it curses"},{"bs":"i prokleti su","en":"and they were cursed"},{"bs":"proklinjemo ih","en":"we curse them"},{"bs":"prokleo ga je","en":"he/it cursed him"}],"ref":"29:25","answerWord":"وَيَلْعَنُ","answerSound":"audio/1a1b8db22d476e0604a9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Ye have chosen only idols instead of Allah. The love between you is only in the life of the world. Then on the Day of Resurrection ye will deny each other and curse each other, and your abode will be the Fire, and ye will have no helpers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prokleti","en":"to curse"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","إِنَّمَا","ٱتَّخَذْتُم","مِّن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","أَوْثَٰنًا","مَّوَدَّةَ","بَيْنِكُمْ","فِى","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","ثُمَّ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","يَكْفُرُ","بَعْضُكُم","بِبَعْضٍ","وَيَلْعَنُ","بَعْضُكُم","بَعْضًا","وَمَأْوَىٰكُمُ","ٱلنَّارُ","وَمَا","لَكُم","مِّن","نَّٰصِرِينَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"لَعَنَ"}},{"id":"laana-33-64-2","words":["verb:laana"],"options":[{"bs":"prokleo je","en":"He cursed"},{"bs":"proklinje ih","en":"he/it curses them"},{"bs":"prokleli smo ih","en":"we cursed them"},{"bs":"i prokleo ih je","en":"and he/it cursed them"}],"ref":"33:64","answerWord":"لَعَنَ","answerSound":"audio/cb08855b973360575e75.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Allah hath cursed the disbelievers, and hath prepared for them a flaming fire,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prokleti","en":"to curse"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَعَنَ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ","وَأَعَدَّ","لَهُمْ","سَعِيرًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"لَعَنَ"}},{"id":"laana-33-68-5","words":["verb:laana"],"options":[{"bs":"i prokuni ih","en":"and curse them"},{"bs":"proklinje ih","en":"he/it curses them"},{"bs":"prokleli smo","en":"we cursed"},{"bs":"i prokleo ih je","en":"and he/it cursed them"}],"ref":"33:68","answerWord":"وَٱلْعَنْهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/8f03ca69ea30a21d9c69.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Our Lord! Oh, give them double torment and curse them with a mighty curse.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prokleti","en":"to curse"},"passage":["رَبَّنَآ","ءَاتِهِمْ","ضِعْفَيْنِ","مِنَ","ٱلْعَذَابِ","وَٱلْعَنْهُمْ","لَعْنًا","كَبِيرًا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"لَعَنَ"}},{"id":"laana-48-6-15","words":["verb:laana"],"options":[{"bs":"i prokleo ih je","en":"and he/it cursed them"},{"bs":"proklinje ih","en":"he/it curses them"},{"bs":"proklela je","en":"she/it cursed"},{"bs":"i prokleo ga je","en":"and he/it cursed him"}],"ref":"48:6","answerWord":"وَلَعَنَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/43df28653b1d65ed976a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And may punish the hypocritical men and the hypocritical women, and the idolatrous men and the idolatrous women, who think an evil thought concerning Allah. For them is the evil turn of fortune, and Allah is wroth against them and hath cursed them, and hath made ready for them hell, a hapless journey's end.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"prokleti","en":"to curse"},"passage":["وَيُعَذِّبَ","ٱلْمُنَٰفِقِينَ","وَٱلْمُنَٰفِقَٰتِ","وَٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","وَٱلْمُشْرِكَٰتِ","ٱلظَّآنِّينَ","بِٱللَّهِ","ظَنَّ","ٱلسَّوْءِ","عَلَيْهِمْ","دَآئِرَةُ","ٱلسَّوْءِ","وَغَضِبَ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلَيْهِمْ","وَلَعَنَهُمْ","وَأَعَدَّ","لَهُمْ","جَهَنَّمَ","وَسَآءَتْ","مَصِيرًا"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"لَعَنَ"}},{"id":"tamia-7-46-17","words":["verb:tamia"],"options":[{"bs":"nadaju se","en":"they hope"},{"bs":"nada se","en":"he hopes"},{"bs":"nadam se","en":"I hope"},{"bs":"nadamo se","en":"we hope"}],"ref":"7:46","answerWord":"يَطْمَعُونَ","answerSound":"audio/bc14018f466831f2ca62.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Between them is a veil. And on the Heights are men who know them all by their marks. And they call unto the dwellers of the Garden: Peace be unto you! They enter it not although they hope (to enter).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nadati se, žudjeti","en":"to hope for, to desire"},"passage":["وَبَيْنَهُمَا","حِجَابٌ","وَعَلَى","ٱلْأَعْرَافِ","رِجَالٌ","يَعْرِفُونَ","كُلًّۢا","بِسِيمَىٰهُمْ","وَنَادَوْا۟","أَصْحَٰبَ","ٱلْجَنَّةِ","أَن","سَلَٰمٌ","عَلَيْكُمْ","لَمْ","يَدْخُلُوهَا","وَهُمْ","يَطْمَعُونَ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"طَمِعَ"}},{"id":"tamia-26-51-1","words":["verb:tamia"],"options":[{"bs":"nadamo se","en":"we hope"},{"bs":"zar se nada?","en":"does he/it hope?"},{"bs":"nadaju se","en":"they hope"},{"bs":"nadam se","en":"I hope"}],"ref":"26:51","answerWord":"نَطْمَعُ","answerSound":"audio/34681b32d6708a26583f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! we ardently hope that our Lord will forgive us our sins because we are the first of the believers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nadati se, žudjeti","en":"to hope for, to desire"},"passage":["إِنَّا","نَطْمَعُ","أَن","يَغْفِرَ","لَنَا","رَبُّنَا","خَطَٰيَٰنَآ","أَن","كُنَّآ","أَوَّلَ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"طَمِعَ"}},{"id":"tamia-26-82-1","words":["verb:tamia"],"options":[{"bs":"nadam se","en":"I hope"},{"bs":"zar se nada?","en":"does he/it hope?"},{"bs":"nadamo se","en":"we hope"},{"bs":"nadaju se","en":"they hope"}],"ref":"26:82","answerWord":"أَطْمَعُ","answerSound":"audio/c8f00d8c50bee9ccd746.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Who, I ardently hope, will forgive me my sin on the Day of Judgment.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nadati se, žudjeti","en":"to hope for, to desire"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِىٓ","أَطْمَعُ","أَن","يَغْفِرَ","لِى","خَطِيٓـَٔتِى","يَوْمَ","ٱلدِّينِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"طَمِعَ"}},{"id":"tamia-70-38-0","words":["verb:tamia"],"options":[{"bs":"zar se nada?","en":"does he/it hope?"},{"bs":"nadam se","en":"I hope"},{"bs":"nadaju se","en":"they hope"},{"bs":"nadamo se","en":"we hope"}],"ref":"70:38","answerWord":"أَيَطْمَعُ","answerSound":"audio/301ee28af9f1d8fc1dd2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Doth every man among them hope to enter the Garden of Delight?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nadati se, žudjeti","en":"to hope for, to desire"},"passage":["أَيَطْمَعُ","كُلُّ","ٱمْرِئٍ","مِّنْهُمْ","أَن","يُدْخَلَ","جَنَّةَ","نَعِيمٍ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"طَمِعَ"}},{"id":"tamia-74-15-1","words":["verb:tamia"],"options":[{"bs":"nada se","en":"he hopes"},{"bs":"nadam se","en":"I hope"},{"bs":"nadamo se","en":"we hope"},{"bs":"nadaju se","en":"they hope"}],"ref":"74:15","answerWord":"يَطْمَعُ","answerSound":"audio/fe3adc7dc7f94fda58f4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Yet he desireth that I should give more.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nadati se, žudjeti","en":"to hope for, to desire"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","يَطْمَعُ","أَنْ","أَزِيدَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"طَمِعَ"}},{"id":"saqa-2-7-57-13","words":["verb:saqa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"otjerali smo ga","en":"we drove it"},{"bs":"bivaju tjerani","en":"they are driven"},{"bs":"tjeramo","en":"we drive"},{"bs":"i otjeran je","en":"and he/it was driven"}],"ref":"7:57","answerWord":"سُقْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/ea9b2de0166e3ce286d8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And He it is Who sendeth the winds as tidings heralding His mercy, till, when they bear a cloud heavy (with rain), We lead it to a dead land, and then cause water to descend thereon and thereby bring forth fruits of every kind. Thus bring We forth the dead. Haply ye may remember.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tjerati, voziti","en":"to drive"},"passage":["وَهُوَ","ٱلَّذِى","يُرْسِلُ","ٱلرِّيَٰحَ","بُشْرًۢا","بَيْنَ","يَدَىْ","رَحْمَتِهِۦ","حَتَّىٰٓ","إِذَآ","أَقَلَّتْ","سَحَابًا","ثِقَالًا","سُقْنَٰهُ","لِبَلَدٍ","مَّيِّتٍ","فَأَنزَلْنَا","بِهِ","ٱلْمَآءَ","فَأَخْرَجْنَا","بِهِۦ","مِن","كُلِّ","ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ","كَذَٰلِكَ","نُخْرِجُ","ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تَذَكَّرُونَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"سَاقَ"}},{"id":"saqa-2-8-6-6","words":["verb:saqa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"bivaju tjerani","en":"they are driven"},{"bs":"i potjerat ćemo","en":"and We will drive"},{"bs":"i otjeran je","en":"and he/it was driven"},{"bs":"otjerali smo ga","en":"we drove it"}],"ref":"8:6","answerWord":"يُسَاقُونَ","answerSound":"audio/a9d0037694be43622f4c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Disputing with thee of the Truth after it had been made manifest, as if they were being driven to death visible.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tjerati, voziti","en":"to drive"},"passage":["يُجَٰدِلُونَكَ","فِى","ٱلْحَقِّ","بَعْدَمَا","تَبَيَّنَ","كَأَنَّمَا","يُسَاقُونَ","إِلَى","ٱلْمَوْتِ","وَهُمْ","يَنظُرُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"سَاقَ"}},{"id":"saqa-2-19-86-0","words":["verb:saqa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"i potjerat ćemo","en":"and We will drive"},{"bs":"i otjeran je","en":"and he/it was driven"},{"bs":"pa smo ga otjerali","en":"so we drove it"},{"bs":"bivaju tjerani","en":"they are driven"}],"ref":"19:86","answerWord":"وَنَسُوقُ","answerSound":"audio/dc5e284fffc43daed49e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And drive the guilty unto hell, a weary herd,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tjerati, voziti","en":"to drive"},"passage":["وَنَسُوقُ","ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","إِلَىٰ","جَهَنَّمَ","وِرْدًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"سَاقَ"}},{"id":"saqa-2-32-27-3","words":["verb:saqa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"tjeramo","en":"we drive"},{"bs":"pa smo ga otjerali","en":"so we drove it"},{"bs":"bivaju tjerani","en":"they are driven"},{"bs":"i otjeran je","en":"and he/it was driven"}],"ref":"32:27","answerWord":"نَسُوقُ","answerSound":"audio/df02af833cc712c569ff.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Have they not seen how We lead the water to the barren land and therewith bring forth crops whereof their cattle eat, and they themselves? Will they not then see?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tjerati, voziti","en":"to drive"},"passage":["أَوَلَمْ","يَرَوْا۟","أَنَّا","نَسُوقُ","ٱلْمَآءَ","إِلَى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","ٱلْجُرُزِ","فَنُخْرِجُ","بِهِۦ","زَرْعًا","تَأْكُلُ","مِنْهُ","أَنْعَٰمُهُمْ","وَأَنفُسُهُمْ","أَفَلَا","يُبْصِرُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"سَاقَ"}},{"id":"saqa-2-35-9-6","words":["verb:saqa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"pa smo ga otjerali","en":"so we drove it"},{"bs":"i potjerat ćemo","en":"and We will drive"},{"bs":"i otjeran je","en":"and he/it was driven"},{"bs":"bivaju tjerani","en":"they are driven"}],"ref":"35:9","answerWord":"فَسُقْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/d75895b72b1051a91170.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Allah it is Who sendeth the winds and they raise a cloud; then We lead it unto a dead land and revive therewith the earth after its death. Such is the Resurrection.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"tjerati, voziti","en":"to drive"},"passage":["وَٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَرْسَلَ","ٱلرِّيَٰحَ","فَتُثِيرُ","سَحَابًا","فَسُقْنَٰهُ","إِلَىٰ","بَلَدٍ","مَّيِّتٍ","فَأَحْيَيْنَا","بِهِ","ٱلْأَرْضَ","بَعْدَ","مَوْتِهَا","كَذَٰلِكَ","ٱلنُّشُورُ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"سَاقَ"}}]